  "reasoning": [
    "Initial setup SELECT and all liveGrant SQL reads now enter one read set. Exact row witnesses and existing owner/revision/full workspace payload CAS are checked in the same batch before the first clock/window update.",
    "Actual committing SQL time and call time are bounded by grant expiry; issuer expiry also bounds the transition when the existing predicate adds an issuer window. Equality is denied by strict greater-than.",
