    "Already-started no-write retry path is unchanged, not an additional current-authority execution permit. Existing inactive/expired issuer behavior is not redefined: service start may be recorded without adding a window under its pre-existing predicate.",
    "No new grant consumption counter or monetary debit exists here. One-time acceptance covers first persisted service clock/window, not general eSIM balance consumption or financial settlement."
  ],
